The best product story
Your v1 story can be:

“Meera does not need another climate-risk report. She needs to know which plants could disrupt production, increase costs, or create compliance exposure by 2040—and what Nimbus should do first. This prototype combines location-based physical hazards with plant-specific dependencies and transition exposure. It distinguishes real operational data from climate projections and clearly labels assumptions, so Meera can use it confidently in front of the board.”

